---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const faqs = [
  {
    q: 'Why should I trust a review site over the manufacturer\u2019s own page?',
    a: 'Manufacturers describe their own rackets in the best possible light \u2014 that\u2019s marketing, not a review. We start from those same specs, then check them against what dozens of real owners and coaches actually experienced on court, and we report the disagreements, not just the highlights.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How do you make money, and does that affect your scores?',
    a: 'We earn a small commission if you buy through a link on our site, at no extra cost to you. It never determines a score \u2014 we\u2019ve rated rackets from brands we\u2019re affiliated with poorly when the reviews warranted it. Full detail is in our affiliate disclosure.',
  },
  {
    q: 'How often are reviews and rankings updated?',
    a: 'Whenever something changes \u2014 a new model launches, prices shift, or enough new owner reviews come in to shift the picture. This isn\u2019t a "publish once" site; rankings are treated as living documents.',
  },
  {
    q: 'I\u2019m a beginner \u2014 where should I start?',
    a: 'Skip the advanced power rackets first. Start with our beginner\u2019s guide to choosing your first racket \u2014 it\u2019ll steer you toward round or teardrop shapes that forgive off-center hits while your technique is still developing.',
  },
  {
    q: 'What if two of your sources disagree on a racket?',
    a: 'We say so directly in the review, rather than picking a side to make the copy cleaner. If coaches love a racket\u2019s power but owners consistently flag it as tiring in long matches, both of those go in the writeup.',
  },
  {
    q: 'Do you review shoes too, or just rackets?',
    a: 'Yes \u2014 shoes get the same treatment: manufacturer specs verified, cross-checked against owner reviews, and updated as new info comes in.',
  },
];
---

<BaseLayout
  title="FAQ"
  description="Answers to common questions about how Courtside Padel researches, scores, and stays independent."
>
  <div class="wrap faq-layout">
    <p class="eyebrow">Frequently asked questions</p>
    <h1>Before you ask, here&rsquo;s what most people want to know</h1>
    <p class="intro">Straight answers on how we research, how we make money, and how to read our reviews.</p>

    <div class="faq-list">
      {faqs.map((item) => (
        <details class="faq-item">
          <summary>{item.q}</summary>
          <p>{item.a}</p>
        </details>
      ))}
    </div>

    <div class="faq-cta">
      <p>Still have a question we haven&rsquo;t covered?</p>
      <a class="btn-primary" href="/contact/">Get in touch</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  .faq-layout {
    padding: 48px var(--gutter) 72px;
    max-width: 760px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 38px;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin: 14px 0 16px;
  }

  .intro {
    font-size: 15px;
    color: var(--muted-2);
    margin-bottom: 36px;
    max-width: 480px;
  }

  .faq-list {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 12px;
  }

  .faq-item {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    padding: 18px 20px;
  }

  .faq-item summary {
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    font-weight: 700;
    cursor: pointer;
    list-style: none;
  }

  .faq-item summary::-webkit-details-marker {
    display: none;
  }

  .faq-item summary::before {
    content: '+';
    display: inline-block;
    width: 18px;
    color: var(--court);
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .faq-item[open] summary::before {
    content: '\2212';
  }

  .faq-item p {
    margin-top: 12px;
    padding-left: 18px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--muted-2);
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .faq-cta {
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 24px;
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    text-align: center;
  }

  .faq-cta p {
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    background: var(--court);
    color: var(--paper);
    padding: 12px 24px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 14px;
    text-decoration: none;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--ink);
  }
</style>
